            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hilbert+bimodules"} bimodules
            in
          %ul
            %li
              %a{:href => "#InTermsOfFredholmHilbertBimodules"} In terms of Fredholm Hilbert C-star-bimodules
          %p
            Then we state the abstract
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category+theory"} category-theoretic
